H("720.d.1.J",3,"A student writes an original program, tests it and publishes it as a downloadable app. This is:","producing original work and publishing it electronically",["copying a program","hiding the program","deleting the program"],"Original solutions can be published digitally.")
H("720.d.1.J",4,"Original work in an independent study should:","solve an identified problem and be shared electronically",["be copied from a classmate","stay unfinished","avoid any audience"],"Originality and publication both matter.")
H("720.d.2.A",3,"A student prepares a report to match the required file type, page size and resolution. This is:","formatting a project to output specifications",["ignoring requirements","random layout","printing blank pages"],"Output specs set format requirements.")
