H("720.d.3.E",3,"A student saves an interview as audio, a poster as an image and notes as text. This is using:","a variety of file formats",["only one format","no files","a single page"],"Different content uses different file types.")
H("720.d.3.E",4,"Choosing the best file format for a video that must play on many devices means picking one that is:","widely supported",["rarely supported","unreadable","very old"],"Compatibility matters.")
H("720.d.4.A",3,"Before using a web article as a source, a student checks who wrote it, when it was updated and whether it matches other sources. This is:","evaluating the design, functionality and accuracy of information",["accepting everything","ignoring the author","skipping verification"],"Evaluate accuracy before using.")
